&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analyst &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Data Analyst to join our team here at ClearScore in London. Analysts play a key role within ClearScore, driving strategy and key decision-making, which ultimately benefits our users, partners, and other teams within the business. We’re seeking an adaptable, curious, and challenge-loving individual to join our growing Global Targeting team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ClearScore has an amazing analytical community which includes Data Analysts, Scientists and Engineers. The community works collaboratively to ensure a landscape in which team members can develop their full potential and deliver maximum business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ClearScore is both a free credit score and report service and the UK’s leading consumer credit marketplace. As a part of the Global Targeting team, you will play a key role in monitoring and reporting on the effectiveness of our Targeting strategy for our users, playing a key part in the formulation, execution and analysis of our experiments, and providing recommendations to drive improvements that drive a better experience for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with your Targeting squad members, providing insights into the performance of our various user segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver data informed and backed recommendations for improvements to our Targeting strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct detailed analysis of A/B tests to drive better outcomes for our users across user journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead in-depth analytics projects, leveraging data to uncover opportunities and address complex business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
